      "description": "Native details/summary behavior with the shipped SVG plus/minus and visible keyboard focus.",
      "html": "<details class=\"ds-details\"><summary class=\"ds-summary\">Inspect the print <svg class=\"ds-disclosure-icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"/><path class=\"ds-disclosure-vertical\" d=\"M12 5v14\"/></svg></summary><p class=\"ds-disclosure-note\">Swipe across the larger proof, or use the arrow keys when it has focus.</p></details>",
      "css": "@font-face{font-family:Sans;src:url('/print/assets/fonts/InstrumentSans-Regular.ttf')}.ds-details{border-top:1px solid var(--line,#cdcdbb);color:var(--ink,#22382e);font-family:Sans,system-ui,sans-serif}.ds-summary{box-sizing:border-box;cursor:pointer;min-height:56px;padding:16px 0;font-size:14px;line-height:1.55;list-style:none;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:15px}.ds-summary::-webkit-details-marker{display:none}.ds-disclosure-icon{width:22px;height:22px;fill:none;stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:1.5;flex:none}.ds-details[open]>.ds-summary .ds-disclosure-vertical{display:none}.ds-summary:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--focus,#7d542d);outline-offset:5px;}.ds-disclosure-note{margin:0 0 18px;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--muted,#53614e)}"
